        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6401 Arched Devonshire Entrance Trim Set with 5152 Drop Tail Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe solid brass Devonshire Entrance Trim was designed with the traditional home in mind. The arched ends paired with the classic 5152 Drop Tail Lever will grant any home a timeless elegance. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\" for a door thickness of 1-3/4\". Available in an array of beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Baldwin Tubular Entrance Trim Set is designed for easy installation for standard pre-drilled wood or metal doors. It is fully reversible to accommodate all door conditions. Forged out of solid brass, it is built to last and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty to assure that it meets the Baldwin standards of excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 6401 Devonshire Traditional Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Entrance handle, cylinder collar, knob, rose and turn piece are manufactured from solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability. </li>\r\n<li>Estate locksets are designed for easy installation in standard pre-bored wood or metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Locksets accommodate a door thickness of 1-3/4”.  Conversion kit available for 2” and 2-1/4” thick doors at an additional charge.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt and latch case are formed of steel for strength.  Most interior working parts are made of solid brass or steel for maximum strength and smooth operation.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset 2-3/8” or 2-3/4” latch and deadbolt supplied standard.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt and latch supplied with a 1” face plate</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt is furnished with a steel reinforcing strike, two 3” security jamb screws and is covered with an armored front to conceal the fasteners and guard against theft. </li> \r\n<li>Latches are supplied standard with a full lip strike.  </li>\r\n<li>Solid brass deadbolt has 1” throw when extended and a hardened steel insert for maximum protection and security. </li> \r\n<li>Solid brass latch bolt has a 1/2” throw when extended to fully engage the door jamb.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder:  Cylinder supplied with 5-pin keying.  </li>\r\n<li>Keys are designed with a 1-1/4” wide bow surface.</li>\r\n<li>Fully Reversible to accommodate most door conditions and facilitate installation</li>\r\n<li>Lockset accommodates a latch to deadbolt center to center measurement of 5-1/2” only.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and PVD (003) polished brass finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Devonshire Entrance Trim , Baldwin 6401",
                "description": "Baldwin 6401 Devonshire Entrance Trim - The solid brass Devonshire Entrance Trim was designed with the traditional home in mind. The arched ends paired with the classic 5152 Drop Tail Lever will grant any home a timeless elegance. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches for a door thickness of 1-3/4 inches. Available in array of beautiful finishes including pvd polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel.",
